 dated_source('src-anime-doraemon-museum','Doraemon: Nobita’s Secret Gadget Museum','Wikipedia contributors','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doraemon:_Nobita%27s_Secret_Gadget_Museum','Characters visit a 22nd-century museum, human technical jobs persist, and an obsolete repair is expensive.','Film-specific evidence; advanced gadgets do not make every good free.',access='Bounded indexed plot paragraphs'),
