(-.15,.65,.2),[[-.7,.6],[.2,.95],[.05,.5]],['Communal survival and supplied goods suggest a limited floor, not an unconditional guarantee.','Local cooperation is substantial, qualified by external support.','All-age human scenario retains actual agriculture, care, infrastructure and distribution work.'],
